# Phase 6 (#5): the Audiobooks list is two-line rows (title / author) with
# cover thumbnails, 4 per screen, like unfiltered Albums (owner decision,
# Revision 3), and NO played/unplayed dots (Revision 2: the 7G tracks no
# such state). A book that was opened still shows no dot afterwards.
# Covers: "The Lighthouse Keeper" and "Winter Stories" have art; "A Field
# Guide to Tones" (PNG covr, unsupported) and the AB fixtures show the
# light grey book tile, like the 7G (owner; rowart.c render_booktile()).
# "Tall Cover Book" (2:3) and "Wide Cover Book" (16:9) are fitted into the
# square thumbnail at build time, on a darkened, blurred copy of the
# cover (owner; artcache.c thumb_fitted(), artblur.c). Author = album
# artist, else artist.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p6-booklist.script
# needs: library
# needs: ab
# needs: np
# timeout: 90
# fresh-db
# trace: ab
# golden: skip page
# DB state: fresh. Passes now on the list part; the page shot, the dot-free
# rows and the ab trace lines need B (ab_page_*) and U (screens/audiobooks.c).

wait 4000
wait_db 45000
mkdir /Audiobooks/AB
copy ../../build/ab-fixtures/pref.m4b /Audiobooks/AB/pref.m4b
copy ../../build/ab-fixtures/nochap.m4b /Audiobooks/AB/nochap.m4b
copy ../../build/np-fixtures/book_23.mp3 /Audiobooks/AB/book_23.mp3
copy ../../build/np-fixtures/book_169.mp3 /Audiobooks/AB/book_169.mp3
update_db_wait_change 60000
art_wait 60000

key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +6 300        # Audiobooks (Compilations off: P11)
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 900
shot list           # two-line rows, thumbnails, no dots
wheel +1 300
wait 300
shot list_row2
key SELECT          # opens the book's page (AB-1), never plays directly
wait 900
shot page
key MENU
wait 700
shot list_back      # still no dot or progress after viewing a book
wheel +5 300        # Wide Cover Book: the list scrolls
wait 600
shot list_end       # Lighthouse, Mini, Tall (2:3) and Wide (16:9) covers
remove /Audiobooks/AB/pref.m4b
remove /Audiobooks/AB/nochap.m4b
remove /Audiobooks/AB/book_23.mp3
remove /Audiobooks/AB/book_169.mp3
quit
